        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944530/extras/86b92e54049c15a2fb4dcfd2410e3228.avif?t=1763215975\" width=1280 height=508 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Knockless</strong> is a tactical, betrayal-filled social deduction game for 2-6 players set in a large carnival. Each round, a hidden Jester is chosen; this player sabotages others and cunningly plays to eliminate survivors one by one. The innocents must work together to complete tasks and uncover who the Jester is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note: Knockless is currently in open beta. The game may contain some bugs or incomplete features, and your valuable feedback is greatly appreciated.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944530/extras/cc66c93af93c7ef429de91e9a295d9f6.poster.avif?t=1763215975\" width=1170 height=730 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944530/extras/cc66c93af93c7ef429de91e9a295d9f6.webm?t=1763215975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944530/extras/cc66c93af93c7ef429de91e9a295d9f6.mp4?t=1763215975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its colorful yet tense atmosphere, <strong>Knockless</strong> offers a fun and strategic challenge you can enjoy with your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944530/extras/eef4a2c9819e221a983718193c3300bd.poster.avif?t=1763215975\" width=1170 height=658 ><sour